Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:52.25,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Um, this is the preview \Nfor the next episode of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.25,0:23:54.61,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,"The Iceblade Sorcerer \NShall Rule the World".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:57.17,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,While Ray is living \Nthe peaceful academy life,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.17,0:24:00.25,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,a ferocious blade hounds him \Nrelentlessly and won't let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.25,0:24:01.78,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,A duel begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:06.39,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest \NSorcerer Releases His Secret Power!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:10.00,ep title,txt,0,0,0,,Episode 4\N{\fscx85}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Releases His Secret Power
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.39,0:24:09.71,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Um, this was Elisa Griffith.
